        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edith Louisa Cavell, Traugott von Sauberzweig\n- Roles: Military Governor of Brussels, Prussian Generalleutnant\n- Places: Brussels\n- Events: execution for treason, replacement in 1915\n\nFacts:\n- In 1915, Traugott von Sauberzweig was the Military Governor of Brussels and held the rank of Prussian Generalleutnant.\n- In 1915, Edith Louisa Cavell was executed for treason by a German firing squad.\n- Edith Louisa Cavell's execution was the reason Traugott von Sauberzweig was replaced as Military Governor of Brussels in 1915.",
